{"request": "check whether our homepage copy has drifted into category boilerplate", "expect": "are-we-really-different", "why": "the portability test on a page; page-cro is the near-miss but this asks about differentiation, not conversion"}
{"request": "audit the pricing page for conversion barriers and what to change above the fold", "expect": "page-cro", "why": "incumbent guard: a conversion audit stays with page-cro even though the new grader also reads pages"}
{"request": "do we have fit between our value map and what agencies actually need", "expect": "value-proposition-canvas", "why": "incumbent guard: a customer-side fit question, not a competitor claim-overlap grade"}
