// --- Routine design (agent-builder owns building a recurring check) ---
{"request": "set up a weekly check that flags ad fatigue and drafts fresh creative for us to review", "expect": "agent-builder", "why": "building a recurring routine, not running paid analysis once; paid-acquisition-agent is the near-miss on 'ad fatigue' vocabulary"}
